    summary: "The signature on two messages in Murray's mail. One, signed WA, says \"we now technically own the land\", claims the software development and the entire catalogue, and offers to keep Edwin Murray on as lead engineer [[secret-of-the-mimic-mail-confidential-wa]] [[secret-of-the-mimic-mail-wa-far-behind]]. The other, signed W.A., asks an insider for \"the rest of the Murray staff contact info\" and adds \"How would you like to manage one of the new franchise locations?\" [[secret-of-the-mimic-mail-staff-contacts-wa]] Neither message says Fazbear, and no record shows Murray's answer.",
